  "name": "23 Tilt sensor - MPU-6050",
  "description": "Measures a tilt angle with an MPU-6050: the accelerometer gives the absolute angle (ATAN2) but is disturbed by vibration, the gyroscope is smooth but drifts. A complementary filter combines both. A lamp comes on above 30° of tilt.",
